{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>In You</b> — Already they trusted in You when they were without trouble they were secure, and in the time of their trouble they trusted in You; You delivered them."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {0 "The final word תפלטמו (You delivered them) includes an object suffix; read as תפלטמו = תפלט + מן + ו, 'you delivered them' or possibly 'you delivered them from' with the preposition absorbed."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:09.597062854Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}